{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie Demolition: Infinite Zombie Shooter</strong> is a <strong>simple</strong> fps game with roguelite mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is locked, you get to pick any weapon, map and game mode right off the bat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you level up, you get to upgrade your weapon base stats (fire rate, damage, etc.) from a random selection and try to survive as long as possible, difficulty increasing the further you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599220/extras/e84c8776b4447f2cf71d68f2dff15e59.poster.avif?t=1750110905\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599220/extras/e84c8776b4447f2cf71d68f2dff15e59.webm?t=1750110905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599220/extras/e84c8776b4447f2cf71d68f2dff15e59.mp4?t=1750110905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo or Co-op up to 4 players. LAN or host games through Steam subsystem</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingame chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 different maps, 3 for each game mode and\u00a017 different weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Game modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Roam:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Roam freely and try to survive as long as possible.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapped:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Trapped in a corner or an alley and try to survive as long as possible.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave Mode:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Black Ops zombie mode insipired mode where you fight waves of zombies.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Noob","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3599220/ad342a2c1cf05a803b6a7d183a7b862ef96b938c.jpg"},{"name":"Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3599220/ca410ff3da466a48901df7bf7856e57d89d96fb8.jpg"},{"name":"Big Dog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3599220/fb784f6c9a934b36581c349585be11b9b962bfaa.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3599220?t=1750110905","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3599220?t=1750110905","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599220/5921b88943ad2ae3db31dacdffb6ed535a553c6a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750110905","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599220/5921b88943ad2ae3db31dacdffb6ed535a553c6a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750110905","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Blood and gun violence."},"d